{"id":"UP-DEBT-pin.allowBuilds.@deepseek-ai/dsh-subprocess-local@file:packages/subprocess/subprocess-...","type":"DEBT","path":"pnpm-workspace.yaml","title":"allowBuilds: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-subprocess-local@file:packages/subprocess/subprocess-local': true","attrs":{"dep":"@deepseek-ai/dsh-subprocess-local","kind":"pin","section":"allowBuilds","statedReason":"Cross-platform boundary for the persistent PTY backend, including ConPTY on Windows. Pulled in by @earendil-works/pi-ai (optional LLM API backend). pnpm lists them only because they ship lifecycle scripts, but those are no-ops we don't need, so we deny them — install still succeeds. JSONL durability calls MoveFileExW with write-through publication on Windows. Consumers pin 3.1.1: Koffi 3.3.2's source build fails under GCC 13 when optional prebuilts are omitted. Upgrade all consumers together after the replacement passes that build and the release packed-install check. The Python runtime deploy includes the reviewed workspace postinstall that restores the executable bit on node-pty's macOS spawn helper."}}
{"id":"UP-DEBT-pin.allowBuilds.node-pty","type":"DEBT","path":"pnpm-workspace.yaml","title":"allowBuilds: node-pty: true","attrs":{"dep":"node-pty","kind":"pin","section":"allowBuilds","statedReason":"Cross-platform boundary for the persistent PTY backend, including ConPTY on Windows."}}
